  "changelog": "Initial release: Douyin search and analysis skill for public data research.\n\n- Enables searching Douyin videos/posts/users, fetching creator content, reading comments, and viewing real-time trending topics.\n- Supports keyword mapping and scenario-based intent recognition\u2014even if users don't mention \"Douyin.\"\n- Pure CLI tool; works with Node.js (no extra dependencies), using only public data\u2014no login, publishing, editing, or downloading.\n- Strict token handling: environment variable only, never prints or stores tokens; outputs only neutral error messages if token is invalid.\n- Results in JSON, detailed parameter mapping, clear error handling, and usage examples included.\n- For internal research and analysis only; respects Douyin terms and privacy.",
